   "key": "var DailyLoopAnalysis.loopState",
   "hash": "ba1a2c2d6314aa01",
   "does": "Classifies the day: undetermined without a workout or z-score; otherwise switches on (above baseline, below baseline, workout intensity): high+easy → underloading unless cumulatively loaded (then absorbing); high+moderate/hard → absorbing; neither → sustainable; low+easy → backedOff; low+moderate/hard → highStrain.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Analysis/DailyLoopAnalysis.swift::var DailyLoopAnalysis.hrvZScore",
